diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 4479b53..403a483 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -15,3 +15,13 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Privacy
+
+The site is built privacy-first; the Privacy Policy page describes the real data flows and must be kept in sync with `src/config/privacy.ts`:
+
+- **No third-party scripts by default.** The click-analytics client is only injected after the visitor opts in through the consent dialog (`src/components/PrivacyConsent.tsx`, `src/utils/consent.ts`). "Manage Privacy Preferences" in the footer reopens it. The ad client stays disabled.
+- **Self-hosted font.** Grenze (OFL) is served from `src/assets/fonts` instead of Google Fonts.
+- **Minimal account data.** Sign-in and sign-up send only username and password, with `credentials: 'omit'`, `referrerPolicy: 'no-referrer'` and `cache: 'no-store'`.
+- **No cookie for just visiting.** The reading-list session cookie is created on the first bookmark, not on page load.
+- **Response headers.** `src/middleware.ts` sets `Referrer-Policy`, `Permissions-Policy` (incl. `browsing-topics=()`) and `X-Content-Type-Options` on every response.
